---
// The one control the app turns on: the switch that links the terminal to the pane, at poster size.
---
<section class="showcase" id="link" data-linked="true" data-showcase aria-labelledby="link-title">
  <h2 class="display" id="link-title" data-reveal>They move <span data-word>together</span></h2>
  <p class="lead" data-reveal style="--i:1">
    <span data-copy="on">At an idle prompt, cd moves the pane and opening a folder moves the shell. In zsh, bash and fish.</span>
    <span data-copy="off" hidden>Unlinked, each keeps its own place. Link again and the pane moves to the shell’s folder.</span>
  </p>
  <div class="showcase-control switch" data-ui>
    <p class="switch-label" id="link-label">Terminal <span data-state>linked to the pane</span></p>
    <button type="button" role="switch" aria-checked="true" aria-labelledby="link-label" data-switch>
      <span data-knob></span>
    </button>
  </div>
</section>
